      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PEAKY COLLINDA (4) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (30.64) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Shepparton. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. MORAINE PIPER (3) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 500m behind Mandolin Storm (29.24) in a Grade 5. The form from her last run stacks up well. Has ability and is one of the better chances. HEATHCOTE RUPEE (8) box seated before sticking on well to finish half a length away in second (31.27) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 545m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Bold showing expected. MY GRACIE (2) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
